  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "0bc4100a-a7d5-09bb-fa34-d1f1406f795c",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"sub-heading-text\">Add premium matcha to your menu for standout desserts, drinks, and modern pairings that impress guests and drive revenue.<br data-w-id=\"60d7e11d-0b90-7ff4-ab5a-21bbe96f9aab\"><br data-w-id=\"6322abce-51ab-271b-7c03-bba0f5407464\">Whether you're plating fine-dining dishes or crafting innovative mocktails, our high-quality Japanese matcha delivers smooth flavor, vibrant color, and health-forward appeal — perfect for today's conscious diner.</p>",
    "text": "Add premium matcha to your menu for standout desserts, drinks, and modern pairings that impress guests and drive revenue.\n\nWhether you're plating fine-dining dishes or crafting innovative mocktails, our high-quality Japanese matcha delivers smooth flavor, vibrant color, and health-forward appeal — perfect for today's conscious diner."
