   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "09ed1faa-f038-8aeb-9737-f67d5cc69b66",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-block-75-2\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"17d8705b-f475-30fd-a461-8fff472d4635\">Reliable B2B partner</strong> – Trusted by chefs and foodservice professionals<br data-w-id=\"4a2fca1d-1150-8cc0-8ca2-196373abd2a9\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"9b12ad24-caa1-dc0f-5ee7-4c14b9f756dc\">Top-quality matcha</strong> – Directly sourced from Japan’s finest farms<br data-w-id=\"54100ef5-b478-6657-a7de-55e2f210f381\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"6b7e124d-3d9a-ae83-c264-0a881149f75c\">Great value</strong> – High yield per gram and consistent quality<br data-w-id=\"5242475e-6f07-982a-5dd6-1511fb1a27db\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"89483944-28bd-8c8c-9797-6b1e31a7aaa3\">Supports innovation</strong> – From lattes to panna cotta to cocktails</div>",
    "text": "✔️ Reliable B2B partner – Trusted by chefs and foodservice professionals\n✔️ Top-quality matcha – Directly sourced from Japan’s finest farms\n✔️ Great value – High yield per gram and consistent quality\n✔️ Supports innovation – From lattes to panna cotta to cocktails"
   },
